content.text:
Now patch combat.js to add dodge, setBlock, blockTime increment, and maybe make environment work. Also player.js calls audio.impact. Add audio.impact.

Let me edit combat.js.

Add methods after `grapple()` maybe:

```js
setBlock(on) {
  if (!this.active) { this.blocking = false; return; }
  this.blocking = !!on;
  if (on) this.blockTime = 0;
  this.player.blocking = this.blocking;
}

dodge() {
  if (!this.active || this.endResult || this.finisherActive) return;
  if (this.cooldowns.dodge > 0 || this.stamina < 9 || this.playerStun > 0) return;
  this.cooldowns.dodge = .85;
  this.stamina -= 9;
  this.iframe = .5;
  const reflex = this.state.player.reflex || 1;
  this.iframe += Math.min(.25, reflex * .03);
  this.audio.dodge?.();
  const f = this.player.getForward();
  const side = Math.random() < .5 ? 1 : -1;
  const nx = this.player.x + (-f.z) * side * 2.2;
  const nz = this.player.z + (f.x) * side * 2.2;
  if (!this.world.isBlocked(nx, nz, this.player.radius)) { this.player.x = nx; this.player.z = nz; }
  this.ui.showCallout('DODGE');
  this.special = clamp(this.special + 4, 0, 100);
}
```

Also block time increment in update: after `this.player.blocking = this.blocking;` add `if (this.blocking) this.blockTime += dt; else this.blockTime = 0;`.

Also reset blockTime in start.

Also combat.start doesn't set `this.blockTime=0` — add.

Also `specialAttack` uses style. fine.

Also `combat.environment()` uses audio.impact optional. Add audio.impact.

Also maybe enemy attack `hit` should account reflex/dodge. iframe handles.

Patch.

